From: ImpulseROM <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Enable fast charging by default

With SEC_FLOATING_FEATURE_BATTERY_SUPPORT_PD_HV=TRUE (needed for super fast charging) the
first-boot defaults write adaptive_fast_charging=0. The stock Note10+ ships it as 1.
---

--- a/smali/com/android/providers/settings/DatabaseHelper.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/providers/settings/DatabaseHelper.smali
@@ -2593,7 +2593,7 @@
 
     if-nez p1, :cond_4
 
-    invoke-direct {p0, v3, v4, v2}, Lcom/android/providers/settings/DatabaseHelper;->loadSetting(Landroid/database/sqlite/SQLiteStatement;Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/Object;)V
+    invoke-direct {p0, v3, v4, v1}, Lcom/android/providers/settings/DatabaseHelper;->loadSetting(Landroid/database/sqlite/SQLiteStatement;Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/Object;)V
 
     goto :goto_2
 
